  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "While Fang Yuan poses as Hei Cheng, Chen Le keeps him company among the scenic palace sites. She is one of the female immortals, with long hair in two buns and a bubbly nature, and by bloodline she is Old Immortal Chen Chi’s great granddaughter. Fang Yuan calls her Le Er when praising a yellow lotus that suits her.",
      "chapters": [
        1122
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "char_hei_cheng",
        "char_chen_chi"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "She has long hair in two buns and a bubbly nature.",
      "chapters": [
        1122
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Chen Chi does not meet Fang Yuan for days while Chen Le escorts him. She later reports to her ancestor that Fang Yuan asked about Chen Chi’s injury, and she worries the concealment will fail as time passes. Fang Yuan already knows the truth and treats the question as a subtle reminder.",
      "chapters": [
        1122
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "guarding-chen-chi",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Chen Wan Yun presses her not to trust the main tribe while they remain trapped in the grotto-heaven. Chen Le still defends Hei Cheng and repeats his talk of injuries from defeating Hei tribe Gu Immortals. Chen Chi speaks of using her wish to marry that superior immortal for his own ends, and Fang Yuan reads the talk as Chen Chi sacrificing her for benefits while fishing for Immortal Gu. Through those days Fang Yuan gains extensive knowledge of Hei Fan grotto-heaven and its immortals from this gullible girl.",
      "chapters": [
        1123
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "family-pressure",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_chen_wan_yun",
        "fac_hei_tribe",
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "sys_immortal_gu",
        "loc_hei_fan_grotto_heaven"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "After Fang Yuan kills Chen Chi’s line of kin, Chen Le activates an immortal killer move that conceals her appearance and runs for help, then sends the warning of bright light so the remaining immortals can defend together. Fang Yuan recognizes that alert as the method she had mentioned, unused for a hundred years, and judges he underestimated her.",
      "chapters": [
        1125
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "warning-of-bright-light",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Still posing as Hei Cheng, Fang Yuan draws her into describing Zheng Tuo’s group. She explains Zhou Min’s farsight weapon light and Feng Jun’s luck path rise from Immortal Succession Mountain, giving Fang Yuan usable details for the fights that follow.",
      "chapters": [
        1126
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "talking-of-rivals",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_zheng_tuo",
        "char_zhou_min",
        "char_feng_jun",
        "loc_immortal_succession_mountain"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "After Fang Yuan kills Chen Wan Yun and other rank seven immortals, Chen Le finds a letter stating that Fang Yuan disguised as her to kill Zheng Tuo. She joins Feng Jun, Zhou Min, and others as cores of Green City battle formation. Fang Yuan thanks her for the information that let him kill Chen Wan Yun and the others, then a flash of light pierces her defenses and kills her instantly. Green City battle formation becomes unstable. Fang Yuan later notes that her concealment method had been her greatest advantage, which she gave up by joining the formation.",
      "chapters": [
        1127
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "death-in-green-city",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    }
  ],
